# Local session-access invalidation uses the dedicated
# SESSION_INGEST_INVALIDATION_SIGNING_SECRET_PROD Secrets Store value. It must
# match the web app's SESSION_INGEST_INVALIDATION_SIGNING_SECRET; the general
# INTERNAL_API_SECRET is not accepted for this route.
